# {{crate_name}}

The {{service_pascal}} gRPC service (`{{proto_package}}`), served natively and
as gRPC-Web on one listener with health (`/livez`, `/readyz`, `/healthz`,
`grpc.health.v1`) and graceful shutdown.

- `src/main.rs` only initialises telemetry, reads `Config` and calls `serve`.
- Handlers return `AppError`; the `?` into `tonic::Status` happens at the
  edge. Read the caller's `CallContext` from the request extensions.
- The contract is `proto/{{proto_package_path}}/{{crate_ident}}.proto`; stubs
  are generated by `build.rs`, messages come from `{{crate_name}}-proto`.
- Tests start the server on port 0 via `runtime(..)` and the runtime handle;
  never with a fixed port or a sleep.

